      "title": "1. Introduction",
      "level": 2,
      "line_start": 3,
      "text_length": 170,
      "text_preview": "The `Fw::Tlm` port is used to pass a serialized telemetry value. It also passes the telemetry channel IS as well a time tag representing the time the channel was written."
